# Normalise line endings. The repo is developed on Windows but several writers
# force LF on purpose -- vision/data/manifest.py and ai/evaluation/experiment_log.py
# open their JSONL with newline="\n" so a record stays one line per row -- and a
# checkout that rewrote those to CRLF would make the two disagree with the files
# they append to. Keeping the whole tree LF in the index avoids the mismatch.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures: never touch these, and do not try to diff them.
*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.task  binary
*.pkl   binary
*.pt    binary
*.parquet binary
*.gz    binary

# Windows launcher: cmd.exe needs CRLF for reliable multi-line parsing.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
